# GB Player: boot Pocket Monsters Green (Japanese), title, new game and Prof. Oak's intro
# (A every 120 frames). The title screen cycles random Pokémon, so gb_title may show a different one.
@gb green
@window 60 120
1200 START 300 A 400 shot:main_menu LEFT 40 DOWN 40 A 150 shot:gb_prompt A 828 shot:gb_copyright 480
shot:gb_intro 710 shot:gb_title 10 START 213 shot:gb_menu 20 DOWN 53 A 173 shot:oak_hello 120 A 93 shot:oak_01
20 A 93 shot:oak_02 20 A 93 shot:oak_03 20 A 93 shot:oak_04 20 A 93 shot:oak_05 20 A 93 shot:oak_06 20 A 93
shot:oak_07 20 A 93 shot:oak_08 20 A 93 shot:oak_09 20 A 93 shot:oak_10 20 A 93 shot:oak_11
